  (text "J7 mates to motherboard J6 using an eight-wire pin-to-pin harness.\n3.3 V comes ONLY from the switched ENC_3V3 rail. Do not connect USB or 5 V."
    (at 20 36 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "11457a65-45a5-5d60-b254-921ecf238438"))
  (text "Pin assignment (J6 = J7)\n1 ENC_3V3   2 GND   3 SCLK   4 GND\n5 MOSI     6 CS    7 GND    8 MISO\nGround contacts are separate harness conductors.\nNo live mating. Check continuity before power."
    (at 20 104 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.0 1.0))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "23800a6f-a51a-51c1-9650-f5d2048124de"))
  (text "C62: local VDD bypass. TEST and SSCK grounded; other unused outputs NC.\nStart with the existing 64 us filter setting; validate angle age and 10 MHz cable operation.\nPCB outline/magnet gap/support geometry are provisional. The shell bracket carries mechanical loads."
    (at 20 163 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.05 1.05))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "6b4d3339-8113-5838-a339-4f72c08c3931"))
